# Service-account keys must never enter an image layer. COPY backend/ ./ would
# otherwise bake the Firebase private key in, readable by anyone who can pull
# it. The backend reads the credential from a read-only mount at runtime -
# see FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PATH in docker-compose.yml.
